# The characterization chain. ARIADNE fits the SED for stellar parameters,
# LACHESIS takes those to isochrones for mass/age/radius, and Nereus fits the
# orbit -- on DAEDALUS underneath (see the inference bundle). Installing this
# bundle is what wires the chain together.
#
# Note the names: the PyPI packages are astro-prefixed. Plain `lachesis` on
# PyPI is a closed-caption segmentation tool by Alberto Pettarin, which would
# install silently and fail at the first import.
astroARIADNE
astrolachesis
